WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.656 --> 00:00:03.366
Bulma is leading an SPV into Senzu Labs.

2
00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:08.059
Goku's in. So are Krillin, Piccolo,
Android 18, and a couple more.

3
00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.414
One small operations team runs
everything behind the deal.

4
00:00:11.831 --> 00:00:16.291
Every new investor means money to match,
numbers to get right, and emails to answer.

5
00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:18.647
Goku pays with no reference.

6
00:00:18.731 --> 00:00:21.286
Krillin pays twice. Piccolo pulls out.

7
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.919
Vegeta's Goten module books a payment only
when its reference matches one investor.

8
00:00:26.004 --> 00:00:27.562
Anything else waits for a person.

9
00:00:28.468 --> 00:00:31.839
Then the close: fees, refunds,
and the amount to wire.

10
00:00:32.138 --> 00:00:34.921
If a total doesn't add up,
it shows no figures at all.

11
00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:39.379
Then the inbox. "I paid
on Monday. Has it landed?"

12
00:00:39.671 --> 00:00:43.868
A passport for KYC. A
withdrawal. A tax certificate.

13
00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:45.810
Each one means the same lookup:

14
00:00:45.874 --> 00:00:48.997
which deal, which investor,
what the ledger says.

15
00:00:49.575 --> 00:00:51.432
Its Trunks module does that first,

16
00:00:51.453 --> 00:00:53.586
and fills the reply from a fixed template.

17
00:00:53.828 --> 00:00:55.813
A person approves it and sends it.

18
00:00:56.562 --> 00:00:58.098
A payment confirmation attached?

19
00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:00.455
It's the sender's word,
not money received.

20
00:01:01.236 --> 00:01:04.636
New bank details, from an
address that only looks right?

21
00:01:04.806 --> 00:01:06.578
Trunks never applies them from an email.

22
00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:09.566
It holds the case for a
call-back and a second person.

23
00:01:10.557 --> 00:01:12.172
Years later, the exit.

24
00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:18.073
Hurdle, catch-up, carry: Goten
splits every pound, step by step.

25
00:01:18.073 --> 00:01:19.930
More investors. More deals.

26
00:01:20.036 --> 00:01:22.276
The same team, on the calls that matter.

27
00:01:23.468 --> 00:01:24.151
Vegeta.

28
00:01:25.136 --> 00:01:26.517
More modules on the way.
